---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Private Chef Services in Portugal | ByHenrique"
  description="Private chef services in Portugal for villa stays, celebrations and private events, with personalised menus, preparation, cooking and a relaxed experience around the table."
>
  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Private Chef Services</p>

        <h1>Your Private Chef Experience</h1>

        <p class="lead">
          My private chef service is about food, culture and a relaxed
          experience around the table.
        </p>

        <p>
          From menu planning and grocery shopping to preparation, cooking,
          serving and cleaning, I take care of the food so you can simply enjoy
          your time together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CHEF AT HOME -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">The Service</p>

            <h2>Private Chef at Home</h2>

            <p>
              A personalised dining experience in the comfort of your villa,
              holiday home or private space.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Menu planning</li>
              <li>Grocery shopping</li>
              <li>Food preparation</li>
              <li>Cooking</li>
              <li>Serving the dishes</li>
              <li>Cleaning the kitchen and areas I use</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="card service-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Four Shores · One Table</p>

            <h2>More Than a Meal</h2>

            <p>
              When I present the dishes, I like to share small stories about
              the ingredients, the cultures behind them and my
              <em>Four Shores · One Table</em> concept.
            </p>

            <p>
              Just enough to give you a little understanding of what you are
              tasting, with a touch of interaction and hopefully a laugh or
              two.
            </p>

            <p>
              I keep it light and natural, giving you plenty of space to enjoy
              your evening.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- BEFORE I ARRIVE -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Before I Arrive</p>

        <h2>A Few Simple Preparations</h2>

        <p class="lead">
          A few simple preparations before I arrive help me put all my
          attention into the cooking.
        </p>

        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <h3>Kitchen & Fridge</h3>

            <p>
              A clean, organised kitchen with clear counter space makes
              everything easier. A considerable amount of fridge space is
              important so I can keep fresh ingredients properly chilled and
              organised.
            </p>

            <p>
              Please also check that the oven is working properly before the
              dinner.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card service-card">
            <h3>Kitchen & Tableware</h3>

            <p>
              Before checking in, I recommend asking the rental property to
              double-check that everything is clean, complete and ready to use,
              with enough plates, large serving dishes, cutlery, glasses and
              cooking equipment for everyone.
            </p>

            <p>
              A clear counter, empty bins and an empty dishwasher make my work
              much smoother.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="card service-note">
          <p>
            The kitchen is my office for the day. Give me a good space to
            create, and I’ll take care of the rest.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TABLE SERVICE -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Table Service</p>

            <h2>Relaxed & Informal</h2>

            <p>
              If you would like dedicated waiter service, this can be arranged
              directly by the guests as a separate service.
            </p>

            <p>
              Many guests on holiday simply enjoy looking after the table
              themselves, clearing plates and sharing the evening together. My
              focus stays on the cooking, the preparation and bringing each dish
              to the table at its best.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card service-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Drinks</p>

            <h2>Wine Pairings & More</h2>

            <p>
              Drinks are not included in the chef service. I’m happy to
              recommend wine pairings for the menu, as well as non-alcoholic
              options.
            </p>

            <p>
              Drinks can then be purchased separately.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OPTIONAL EXTRAS -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Optional Extras</p>

        <h2>Little Details That Make a Difference</h2>

        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <h3>Flowers for the Table</h3>

            <p>
              A beautiful floral arrangement can add the final touch. I can
              arrange something simple and elegant according to the size of
              your table.
            </p>

            <p>
              Usually €25–€65 depending on the arrangement.
            </p>

            <p>
              As we say in my homeland, Jordan, “the eye eats before the mouth.”
              I like the table to look as good as the food tastes.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card service-card">
            <h3>Birthday Cake</h3>

            <p>
              Happy to arrange one if you are celebrating. This is an
              additional cost and will be confirmed separately.
            </p>

            <p>
              Flowers and birthday cakes are not included in the chef service
              price and are paid separately.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CLOSING -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="card service-note">
          <p class="eyebrow">The ByHenrique Experience</p>

          <h2>Food, Culture & A Memorable Table</h2>

          <p>
            Being a chef is not simply a job for me. It is my ultimate
            passion, and somehow that passion led me to become a private chef
            and host.
          </p>

          <p>
            Let me bring joy and create a memorable experience for you.
          </p>

          <a class="button" href="/encomendar">
            Request Your Private Chef Experience
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>